{"id":"sanador","pack":"Khans_RPG_Klasses_-_Mender_v1.0.1","class":{"name":"Mender","lore":["Choose the Mender Class"],"name_es":"Sanador","role_es":"Soporte · curación","desc_es":"Un sanador que mantiene vivos a sus aliados: rayos que curan o hieren, luz purificadora y un orbe que reparte curación.","color":"#7dff9a"},"skills":[{"id":"mender_lifebound","name":"Lifebound","lore":["•--","Allies near you are gently healed over time through Regeneration.","Periodically, a healing pulse radiates outward from you.","•--"],"cooldown":0.0,"mana":0.0,"passive":{"type":"TIMER","timer":100},"mods":{"timer":100.0,"damage":0.0,"mana":0.0,"stamina":0.0,"cooldown":0.0},"entry":"mender_lifebound","icon":"COAL:1940","modes":["TIMER"],"name_es":"Vínculo Vital","desc_es":"Pasiva: los aliados cercanos se curan poco a poco y de vez en cuando sueltas un pulso de curación."},{"id":"mender_spiritbolt","name":"Spirit Bolt","lore":["•--","Launch a small spiritbolt. Damages enemies on hit,","but heals players slightly instead.","•--","🗡 {damage} Damage","⌛ {cooldown}s Cooldown","💚 10% Healing","•--"],"cooldown":0.9,"mana":0.0,"passive":null,"mods":{"timer":0.0,"damage":10.0,"mana":0.0,"stamina":0.0,"cooldown":0.9},"entry":"mender_spiritbolt","icon":"COAL:1941","modes":["LEFT_CLICK"],"name_es":"Rayo Espiritual","desc_es":"Un pequeño rayo espiritual que hiere a los enemigos y cura un poco a los jugadores."},{"id":"mender_cascadebolt","name":"Cascade Bolt","lore":["•--","Fire a larger bolt that splits on impact. If it hits a mob, it jumps to 2 others,","then splits again to hit 3 more—dealing reduced damage with each jump (up to 6 total targets).","If it hits a player, it splits once to heal 2 nearby allies, with healing slightly reduced per jump.","•--","🗡 {damage} Damage","⌛ {cooldown}s Cooldown","💚 30% Healing","•--"],"cooldown":2.0,"mana":0.0,"passive":null,"mods":{"timer":0.0,"damage":10.0,"mana":0.0,"stamina":0.0,"cooldown":2.0},"entry":"mender_cascadebolt","icon":"COAL:1942","modes":["RI